        "input": "4\n3\n1 2 3\n3\n3 2 1\n5\n2 3 1 4 5\n6\n2 1 4 3 5 6",
        "output": "0\n1\n1\n3",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest Case 1 : The given array is already sorted.\nTest Case 2 : We can choose i=3i = 3i=3 and sort the prefix A[1,3]A[1, 3]A[1,3] which is also the entire array. The cost is A3=1A_3 = 1A3​=1 (before sorting)."
      }
